WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:04.760
"We need a spell," Cat said.

2
00:00:04.761 --> 00:00:08.534
"Where's your wand?"

3
00:00:08.535 --> 00:00:13.855
Tom's wand was still stuck in the mud.

4
00:00:13.856 --> 00:00:18.792
Cat pulled and tugged.

5
00:00:18.793 --> 00:00:22.505
But the wand stayed stuck.

6
00:00:22.506 --> 00:00:28.820
Then Tom and Cat pulled together.

7
00:00:28.821 --> 00:00:36.788
Pop! Out came the wand!

8
00:00:36.789 --> 00:00:40.957
"Time for a spell!" Tom said.

9
00:00:40.958 --> 00:00:44.450
He waved his wand.

10
00:00:44.451 --> 00:00:50.964
Poof! A pink bunny appeared.

11
00:00:50.965 --> 00:00:54.682
Poof! A blueberry bush appeared.

12
00:00:54.683 --> 00:01:05.761
Tom waved his wand again and again . . . And again.

13
00:01:05.762 --> 00:01:09.711
Tom looked at Cat.

14
00:01:09.712 --> 00:01:13.779
"I'm a terrible wizard," he said.

15
00:01:13.780 --> 00:01:21.789
"You have a kind heart," Cat said.

16
00:01:21.790 --> 00:01:25.157
Tom closed his eyes.

17
00:01:25.158 --> 00:01:32.006
One more time he thought of Princess Mary.

18
00:01:32.007 --> 00:01:35.701
One more time he lifted his wand. "Pinkberry

19
00:01:35.702 --> 00:01:38.293
bush so rare . . . Appear

20
00:01:38.294 --> 00:01:41.097
right there!" Poof!

21
00:01:41.098 --> 00:01:44.971
Smoke filled the clearing. Tom

22
00:01:44.972 --> 00:01:49.751
coughed—and then he saw it. "A

23
00:01:49.752 --> 00:01:58.480
pinkberry bush!" Cat cried. Tom

24
00:01:58.481 --> 00:02:02.341
filled his sack with juicy pinkberries. "Take

25
00:02:02.342 --> 00:02:06.017
some branches too," Cat said. "I'll

26
00:02:06.018 --> 00:02:12.877
explain later!" Cat

27
00:02:12.878 --> 00:02:32.643
led the way out of the Dark Forest. Soon

28
00:02:32.644 --> 00:02:48.599
Tom was back at the palace .

29
00:02:48.600 --> 00:02:52.679
"Pinkberries!" the royal doctor cried.

30
00:02:52.680 --> 00:03:09.263
"I'll make the juice!" Cook cried.

31
00:03:09.264 --> 00:03:13.074
The royal gardener took the branches from Tom.

32
00:03:13.075 --> 00:03:17.247
"I'll plant them in the Royal Garden," he said.

33
00:03:17.248 --> 00:03:19.639
Dirk was furious.

34
00:03:19.640 --> 00:03:32.092
But everyone else was very, very happy.

